# Project pnpm settings (pnpm 11).
# esbuild (transitive via Vite) ships a native binary and must run its
# postinstall build script. This is the stable, non-interactive way to allow it.
# Note: in pnpm 11 the canonical home is `onlyBuiltDependencies` in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml; this .npmrc entry is kept for tooling compatibility.
